    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just started taking atorvastatin for my cholesterol but i love grapefruit juice in the mornings. is it okay to keep having it or should i stop? also do i need to take it at a specific time of day to make it work better?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
